<div class="about-main">
<header class="page-head kit-reveal">
<p class="kicker">
<span class="sr-only">About YAP Arena</span>
<span class="ins" aria-hidden="true">abovt yap arena</span>
</p>
<h1 class="page-title">
<span class="sr-only">Make room for the other side.</span>
<span class="ins" aria-hidden="true">make room for <em>the other side.</em>
</span>
</h1>
<p class="page-lead">YAP Arena is a home for live debates and the ideas that connect them.</p>
</header>
<section class="about-copy measure">
<h2 class="section-title">
<span class="sr-only">What you can do</span>
<span class="ins" aria-hidden="true">what yov can do</span>
</h2>
<p>Browse topics, watch live video debates and replays, and see who is debating. Sign in to pick your handle, follow people and topics, and queue on a side to debate someone live. Listings marked Demo are fictional examples.</p>
<p>A listing’s status does not guarantee that video is available or that a result has been decided. Yap Coins are play money with no cash value. Bot activity is synthetic and labeled. Real funds are unavailable.</p>
<h2 class="section-title" id="measurement">
<span class="sr-only">Cookies and usage measurement</span>
<span class="ins" aria-hidden="true">cookies and vsage measvrement</span>
</h2>
<p>We set an analytics cookie only if you accept it in the cookie banner. It counts discovery pages, watch time, replay starts, matching, follows, reports and return visits, and may be linked to your signed-in account to separate founder-affiliated activity. We don't store search text, chat text or IP addresses in these measurements. Use Cookie settings in the footer to turn it off and delete your measurements. Raw events and watch sessions are kept for up to 90 days; an unused consent expires after 180 days. Debate completion is counted from public event state without a browser identifier. See the <a href="/cookies">Cookie Policy</a>.</p>
<a class="btn btn-primary" href="/debates">Explore debates</a>
</section>
</div>
<div class="about-emblem">
<div class="living-emblem" data-living-emblem aria-hidden="true">
