<header class="legal-hero kit-reveal">
<p class="kicker legal-eyebrow">
<span class="sr-only">YAP Arena · Legal</span>
<span class="ins" aria-hidden="true">yap arena · legal</span>
</p>
<h1 class="page-title legal-title">
<span class="sr-only">Privacy policy</span>
<span class="ins" aria-hidden="true">privacy policy</span>
</h1>
<p class="legal-lede">YAP Arena is a live debate site run from Québec. This policy explains, in plain terms, what we collect when you watch, sign in or debate, why we collect it, who processes it for us, where it is stored, how long we keep it and how to reach us about it.</p>
<dl class="legal-meta">
<div>
<dt>Updated</dt>
<dd>
<time datetime="2026-10-30">October 30, 2026</time>
</dd>
</div>
<div>
<dt>Version</dt>
<dd>2026-10-30</dd>
</div>
</dl>
<ul class="legal-glance">
<li>
<strong>Debates are public</strong>
<span>Debaters’ video, voice and username are shown live and in public replays.</span>
</li>
<li>
<strong>So is the AI outline</strong>
<span>Captions and an AI summary of each turn are shown with the debate.</span>
</li>
<li>
<strong>Chat is public</strong>
<span>Messages show with your username. Reports stay private.</span>
</li>
<li>
<strong>No ads, no selling</strong>
<span>We don’t sell personal information or use it for advertising.</span>
</li>
<li>
<strong>Analytics only if you accept</strong>
<span>The analytics cookie stays off until you choose Accept all.</span>
</li>
<li>
<strong>Stored in the United States</strong>
<span>Our database, servers and main providers are outside Québec and Canada.</span>
</li>
<li>
<strong>18 and older</strong>
<span>YAP Arena is only for adults.</span>
</li>
<li>
<strong>You stay in control</strong>
<span>Download your data, change your choices, or ask us to delete it.</span>
</li>
</ul>
</header>
<div class="legal-layout">
<nav class="legal-toc" aria-labelledby="legal-toc-title">
<h2 id="legal-toc-title">
<span class="sr-only">On this page</span>
<span class="ins" aria-hidden="true">on this page</span>
</h2>
