<main id="main">
<div class="container legal-main">
<nav class="legal-switch chips" aria-label="Legal">
<a class="chip" href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
<a class="chip" href="/terms">Terms</a>
<a class="chip" href="/cookies" aria-current="page">Cookies</a>
</nav>
<header class="legal-hero kit-reveal">
<p class="kicker legal-eyebrow">
<span class="sr-only">YAP Arena · Legal</span>
<span class="ins" aria-hidden="true">yap arena · legal</span>
</p>
<h1 class="page-title legal-title">
<span class="sr-only">Cookie policy</span>
<span class="ins" aria-hidden="true">cookie policy</span>
</h1>
<p class="legal-lede">This policy explains the cookies and similar technologies YAP Arena uses, why we use them and how you control them. It is part of our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
<dl class="legal-meta">
<div>
<dt>Updated</dt>
<dd>
<time datetime="2026-10-30">October 30, 2026</time>
</dd>
</div>
<div>
<dt>Version</dt>
<dd>2026-10-30</dd>
</div>
</dl>
<ul class="legal-glance">
<li>
<strong>Essential by default</strong>
<span>Only the cookies YAP Arena needs to work are on until you choose.</span>
</li>
<li>
<strong>Analytics is your choice</strong>
<span>Accept or reject it in the banner; both buttons weigh the same.</span>
</li>
<li>
<strong>No advertising cookies</strong>
<span>No ad networks, no cross-site tracking, no third-party analytics.</span>
</li>
<li>
<strong>Change it anytime</strong>
<span>Cookie settings is at the bottom of every page and in your account.</span>
</li>
</ul>
</header>
<div class="legal-layout">
<nav class="legal-toc" aria-labelledby="legal-toc-title">
<h2 id="legal-toc-title">
<span class="sr-only">On this page</span>
<span class="ins" aria-hidden="true">on this page</span>
</h2>
<ol>
<li>
<a href="#what">What cookies are</a>
</li>
<li>
<a href="#categories">How we use cookies</a>
</li>
<li>
<a href="#list">The cookies we set</a>
</li>
<li>
<a href="#storage">Similar technologies</a>
</li>
<li>
<a href="#third-parties">Other services</a>
</li>
<li>
<a href="#choices">Your choices</a>
</li>
<li>
<a href="#changes">Changes to this policy</a>
</li>
<li>
<a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</li>
</ol>
</nav>
<article class="legal-body">
<section id="what" aria-labelledby="what-title">
<h2 id="what-title">What cookies are</h2>
<p>Cookies are small text files a website stores in your browser. They let the site recognize your browser between pages, for example to keep you signed in. Some last only for a visit; others stay for a set time.</p>
<p>Websites also use similar technologies, such as your browser’s local and session storage, which keep small values on your device. This policy covers both, and calls them all “cookies” where the difference doesn’t matter.</p>
</section>
<section id="categories" aria-labelledby="categories-title">
<h2 id="categories-title">How we use cookies</h2>
<table class="legal-table">
<caption>Cookie categories</caption>
<thead>
<tr>
<th scope="col">Category</th>
<th scope="col">What it does</th>
<th scope="col">Your choice</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th scope="row">Strictly necessary</th>
<td data-label="What it does">Signs you in, keeps your session secure, limits abuse and remembers your choices, such as your cookie choice and captions setting.</td>
<td data-label="Your choice">Always on. YAP Arena can’t work without them.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">Analytics</th>
<td data-label="What it does">Counts which debates and pages people find, watch time, replay starts and return visits, so we can see what works and improve YAP Arena.</td>
<td data-label="Your choice">Off until you accept. You can turn it off anytime.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">Advertising</th>
<td data-label="What it does">None. We don’t use advertising or cross-site tracking cookies.</td>
<td data-label="Your choice">Not used.</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>All our cookies are first-party: yaparena.com sets them, and they are sent only to yaparena.com.</p>
</section>
<section id="list" aria-labelledby="list-title">
<h2 id="list-title">The cookies we set</h2>
<table class="legal-table">
<caption>Cookies set by yaparena.com</caption>
<thead>
<tr>
<th scope="col">Cookie</th>
<th scope="col">Category</th>
<th scope="col">Purpose</th>
<th scope="col">Duration</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th scope="row">__Host-session</th>
<td data-label="Category">Strictly necessary</td>
<td data-label="Purpose">Keeps you signed in. It holds a random value, never your email.</td>
<td data-label="Duration">7 days, or until you sign out</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">__Host-sign-in</th>
<td data-label="Category">Strictly necessary</td>
<td data-label="Purpose">Ties a sign-in in progress to your browser, for security.</td>
<td data-label="Duration">10 minutes</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">yap_media_guard</th>
<td data-label="Category">Strictly necessary</td>
<td data-label="Purpose">A signed random value that limits how fast one browser can load pages and video, to prevent abuse.</td>
<td data-label="Duration">15 minutes</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">__Host-measurement</th>
<td data-label="Category">Analytics</td>
<td data-label="Purpose">Set only after you accept analytics. A random value that groups this browser’s measurements; we store only a fingerprint of it.</td>
<td data-label="Duration">180 days, or until you turn analytics off</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>Our cookies are marked HttpOnly and Secure, so page scripts can’t read them and they are only sent over HTTPS.</p>
</section>
<section id="storage" aria-labelledby="storage-title">
<h2 id="storage-title">Similar technologies</h2>
<p>These values stay on your device. We don’t send them to our servers except where the purpose says so, and none of them is used for analytics or advertising.</p>
<table class="legal-table">
<caption>Similar technologies on your device</caption>
<thead>
<tr>
<th scope="col">Name</th>
<th scope="col">Category</th>
<th scope="col">Purpose</th>
<th scope="col">Duration</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th scope="row">yaparena-measurement-declined</th>
<td data-label="Category">Strictly necessary</td>
<td data-label="Purpose">Remembers that you rejected analytics, so we don’t ask again.</td>
<td data-label="Duration">Until you clear site data</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">yap:live-captions</th>
<td data-label="Category">Strictly necessary</td>
<td data-label="Purpose">Remembers whether you turned captions on or off.</td>
<td data-label="Duration">Until you clear site data</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">yaparena-stake-defaults, -review, -explained</th>
<td data-label="Category">Strictly necessary</td>
<td data-label="Purpose">Your Yap Coins ticket defaults, whether to show the review step, and that you’ve seen the explanation.</td>
<td data-label="Duration">Until you clear site data</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">yaparena-results-seen</th>
<td data-label="Category">Strictly necessary</td>
<td data-label="Purpose">Which Yap Coins results you’ve already seen.</td>
<td data-label="Duration">Until you clear site data</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">yaparena-auth-return, yaparena-coin-confirmation</th>
<td data-label="Category">Strictly necessary</td>
<td data-label="Purpose">The page to return to after signing in, and a Yap Coins confirmation in progress.</td>
<td data-label="Duration">Until you close the tab</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">media-speaker</th>
<td data-label="Category">Strictly necessary</td>
<td data-label="Purpose">While you debate: your chosen camera, microphone and mute state.</td>
<td data-label="Duration">Until you close the tab</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">Offline page</th>
<td data-label="Category">Strictly necessary</td>
<td data-label="Purpose">Our service worker keeps a copy of the offline page and its stylesheet, shown if you lose your connection.</td>
<td data-label="Duration">Until we update it or you clear site data</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</section>
<section id="third-parties" aria-labelledby="third-parties-title">
<h2 id="third-parties-title">Other services</h2>
<p>We don’t load third-party scripts, analytics or advertising on yaparena.com.</p>
<ul>
<li>
<strong>Sign-in.</strong> When you sign in, you go to our sign-in provider, Auth0, at auth.yaparena.com. Auth0 sets its own cookies there to run sign-in. If you choose Google, Google may set cookies on its own sites. Their policies apply: <a href="https://www.okta.com/privacy-policy/">Okta (Auth0)</a> and <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/cookies">Google</a>.</li>
<li>
<strong>Video and replays.</strong> Live video comes from LiveKit and replays from Cloudflare. Your browser connects to them directly, so they receive your IP address, but they don’t set cookies on yaparena.com.</li>
</ul>
</section>
<section id="choices" aria-labelledby="choices-title">
<h2 id="choices-title">Your choices</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<strong>The banner.</strong> On your first visit, choose <strong>Accept all</strong>, <strong>Reject all</strong> or <strong>Customize</strong>. Both buttons weigh the same, and until you choose, analytics stays off. If your browser sends a Global Privacy Control signal, we treat it as Reject all and don’t show the banner.</li>
<li>
<strong>Cookie settings.</strong> Change your choice anytime with <strong>Cookie settings</strong> at the bottom of any page, in your account’s Privacy tab, or <a href="/home#cookie-settings">here</a>. Turning analytics off deletes the measurements collected through that browser.</li>
<li>
<strong>Your browser.</strong> You can block or delete cookies in your browser’s settings. If you block strictly necessary cookies, you won’t be able to sign in.</li>
</ul>
<p>Your choice is saved for each browser. If you use another browser or device, or clear your cookies, we ask again.</p>
</section>
<section id="changes" aria-labelledby="changes-title">
<h2 id="changes-title">Changes to this policy</h2>
<p>When we change how we use cookies, we update this page and its date. If we add a new kind of optional cookie, we ask for your choice again.</p>
</section>
<section id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
<h2 id="contact-title">Contact</h2>
<p>Questions about cookies go to <mark class="legal-todo">[Privacy email]</mark>.</p>
</section>
<a class="legal-top" href="#main">Back to top <span aria-hidden="true">↑</span>
</a>
</article>
</div>
</div>
</main>
<footer class="site-footer">
